In Queue - job is waiting for another job to finish
Sending - certificates are being send
Complete for Today - We have reached limit of emails send
Complete - job is completed</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Status</label>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Picklist</type>
        <valueSet>
